{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting started","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, and create it at launch."}],"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference"},{"text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","type":"reference"},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Add the package","anchor":"Add-the-package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". In ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"0.9.0\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links a binary framework, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which SwiftPM checks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Register the wallet","anchor":"Register-the-wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app’s Info.plist (","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleURLTypes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and pass the URL the app receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the issuance.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificates: ","type":"text"},{"code":"issuerRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for credentials, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"verifierRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because it sent the offer.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Provide the keys and the storage","anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key — the one a credential is bound to — signs only when presenting, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode first: add an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Implement the Wallet Provider","anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s talking to your genuine app.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","type":"reference"},{"text":" error; any other is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Create the wallet","anchor":"Create-the-wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create one ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference"},{"text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle of leaves its keys behind.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots)","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Ship the release build","anchor":"Ship-the-release-build"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links the release build of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app must never have; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","type":"reference"},{"text":" says which one an app has,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Next steps","anchor":"Next-steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/platform":{"title":"platform","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"platform"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/platform","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A key store, credential store or Wallet Provider call failed; its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message follows."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ReceivingCredentials":{"title":"Receiving credentials","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","kind":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/GoingToProduction":{"title":"Going to production","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction","abstract":[{"text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","kind":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/network":{"title":"network","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/network","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A request couldn’t be made, got no answer, or timed out. Retryable."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"title":"FileCredentialStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"url":"\/document